@startuml Cancel Reservation Sequence

actor User
participant UI
participant ReservationController
participant ReservationService
participant ReservationRepository
database DB

User -> UI: Select reservation
User -> UI: Request reservation cancellation

UI -> ReservationController: DELETE /reservations/{id}
activate ReservationController

ReservationController -> ReservationService: cancel(id)
activate ReservationService

ReservationService -> ReservationRepository: findById(id)
activate ReservationRepository

ReservationRepository -> DB: SELECT reservation by ID
DB --> ReservationRepository: reservation row / empty

ReservationRepository --> ReservationService: Optional<Reservation>
deactivate ReservationRepository

alt Reservation does not exist
    ReservationService --> ReservationController: ResourceNotFoundException
    ReservationController --> UI: 404 Not Found
    UI --> User: Display cancellation rejected

else Reservation cannot be cancelled
    ReservationService --> ReservationController: IllegalStateException
    ReservationController --> UI: 409 Conflict
    UI --> User: Display cancellation rejected

else Reservation can be cancelled

    ReservationService -> ReservationRepository: delete(reservation)
    activate ReservationRepository

    ReservationRepository -> DB: DELETE reservation
    note right of DB: Seats of the reservation\nbecome FREE
    DB --> ReservationRepository: deleted

    ReservationRepository --> ReservationService: void
    deactivate ReservationRepository

    ReservationService --> ReservationController: void
    ReservationController --> UI: 204 No Content
    UI --> User: Display cancellation result\n(reservation cancelled)

end

deactivate ReservationService
deactivate ReservationController

@enduml
